## 1. Introduction & Overview

Welcome to **CleanMyPhone** ("we", "our", or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring you have complete control over your device's data. 

CleanMyPhone is engineered as a **100% On-Device, Privacy-First Storage Utility**. All file indexing, duplicate photo detection, cache scanning, and storage analysis are performed strictly on your physical Android device. **We do not collect, store, transmit, sell, or share any of your personal files, photos, videos, documents, or personal data with any third parties or remote servers.**

By downloading, installing, or using CleanMyPhone, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

