## 4. Third-Party Services & Analytics

CleanMyPhone integrates trusted third-party SDKs to support app operations, measure stability, and deliver notifications:
- **Google Mobile Ads (AdMob):** Used to display banner, interstitial, and rewarded ads to support free features. AdMob may process Advertising ID (`AD_ID`) and coarse device metrics in accordance with Google's Privacy Policy.
- **Firebase Crashlytics & Analytics (Google LLC):** Used to monitor app stability, analyze crash stack traces, and measure user feature adoption to diagnose technical bugs.
- **OneSignal:** Used to deliver optional push notifications, cleanup reminders, and storage alert messages.

These service providers process data strictly in compliance with their respective privacy policies and Google Play Developer Program Policies.

