## 8. International Privacy Rights

### 8.1. European Union (GDPR) Compliance
If you reside in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have rights under the General Data Protection Regulation:
- **Right to Access & Portability:** All your data remains on your device under your direct control.
- **Right to Rectification & Erasure:** You can delete any indexed cache or app data at any time directly through the app or Android system settings.
- **Right to Restrict Processing:** You can revoke storage or usage permissions at any time via Android Settings.

### 8.2. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA / CPRA) Compliance
If you are a California resident:
- **We do not sell your personal information.**
- **We do not share your personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising.**
- **We do not collect sensitive personal consumer records.**

